[00:00.000] 作词 : Otto Harbach/Jerome Kern
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Otto Harbach/Jerome Kern
[00:13.400]They asked me how I knew my true love was true. Oh,
[00:27.400]I of course replied
[00:31.400]"something here inside cannot be denied."
[00:46.400]They said "someday you'll find all who love are blind."
[00:56.400]Oh,When your heart's on fire,
[01:05.400]you must realize smoke gets in your eyes
[01:21.400]So I chaffed them
[01:25.400]and I gaily laughed to think they could doubt my love.
[01:37.400]Yet today my love has flown away, I am without my love.
[01:54.400]Now laughing friends deride tears I cannot hide. Oh,
[02:08.400]So I smile and say
[02:13.400]"when a lovely flame dies, smoke gets in your eyes!"
[02:24.400]Smoke gets in your eyes
